ight: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260329/202603292320487288_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260329/202603292320487288_720.jpg"> </div><p>【图多尔下课】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-29/69c25f7ea0cffnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">救火失败！官方：热刺临时主帅图多尔下课，带队6周7战仅1胜</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260329/202603292246485460.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260329/202603292246485460.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260329/202603292246485460.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">官方消息，热刺临时主教练图多尔下课，提前结束了原本将在本赛季末到期的合同。图多尔此次执教热刺仅持续了44天。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-30/69c952f17bb87native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗马诺：热刺正全力说服德泽尔比执掌帅印，目标夏窗前敲定任命</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.55" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260211/698bdec50b9d8.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.55" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.55" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260211/698bdec50b9d8.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260211/698bdec50b9d8.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">记者罗马诺报道，热刺目前正全力争取聘请德泽尔比担任主帅。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-30/69c97890364c8native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">求救！记者：热刺给德泽尔比开高额保级奖金+签字费 盼马上接手</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.45" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_230115/63c3afcee5023.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.45" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.45" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_230115/63c3afcee5023.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_230115/63c3afcee5023.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">记者Alex Crook消息，热刺正在努力说服德泽尔比，希望他能尽快接手球队。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-30/69c95e9e5b71cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">带队仅44天！记者：图多尔的下课没有得到补偿金</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260317/69b83d66be38c_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="pla