1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.72" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.72" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260330/zhanbao_image_1869234_1774817104_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260330/zhanbao_image_1869234_1774817104_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>友谊赛对阵，法国3-1击败哥伦比亚，法国方面杜埃双响，图拉姆破门。</p><p>【其他新闻】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-30/69c99c68282abnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">红黑心！隆戈：托纳利希望去英超西甲豪门，并在4年内重返米兰</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.51" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260327/69c5c5ab25de6.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.51" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.51" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260327/69c5c5ab25de6.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260327/69c5c5ab25de6.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">记者隆戈消息，托纳利在认真考虑离开纽卡，寻求职业生涯的下一步发展。并且，他的未来计划里包括AC米兰。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-29/69c948588cee5native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">闷平墨西哥！穆帅：C罗不在时葡萄牙就是普通球队，对手不怕你</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.85" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260329/zhanbao_image_1867910_1774752122_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.85" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.85" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260329/zhanbao_image_1867910_1774752122_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260329/zhanbao_image_1867910_1774752122_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">此前葡萄牙0-0墨西哥，C罗未在阵中。进球网消息，穆里尼奥在采访中谈到了这一情况。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-29/69c947204f127native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">莫雷托：为国米生涯画上句号，阿切尔比将在赛季结束后离开国米</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250507/681aff7e7ab70.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250507/681aff7e7ab70.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250507/681aff7e7ab70.jpg"> </div><p><span style=