.com/uploads/news/day_260330/202603300326233315.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">英格兰第五级别联赛沃金俱乐部官方宣布，前英格兰国脚迪福出任球队主帅。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-30/69c9b05426d6cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">明示？恩佐：我很喜欢马德里这座城市，那里和布宜诺斯艾利斯很像</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.92" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260330/202603300706482042.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.92" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.92" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260330/202603300706482042_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260330/202603300706482042_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">记者罗马诺消息，恩佐在采访中被问及向往的城市，他表示自己最想住在马德里。</span></p><a href="http://m.zhibo8.cc/topic/index.html?id=165" class="hide" style="     background: url('http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_200905/zt_4221599266620.png') no-repeat;     background-size: cover;     display: block;     height: 150px;     max-width: 690px;     color: white;     margin: 24px auto;     position: relative;     border-radius: 10px;     overflow: hidden; ">     <div style="     position: absolute;     height: 50px;     line-height: 50px;     font-size: 16px;     left: 0;     bottom: 0;     right: 0;     text-indent: 15px;     background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);     color:white; ">直播吧足球早报-早看早知道</div>      <div style="     position: absolute;     height: 20px;     line-height: 20px;     font-size: 12px;     right: 10px;     top: 10px;     border-radius: 5px;     width: 40px;     text-a